{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397","id":6358248797,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABevstXQ","number":1397,"title":"Bind primary CAS captures for four stable-publication rows without clearing scientific holds","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-12T20:18:44Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T20:18:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Independent review of the actual stable-ID publication candidate at source commit `f4b6712d9b8a888c03389149283ee2b7d124bf13` found a bounded evidence-capture gap. Four historically supported CAS rows have prior reports narrating external research, but the current 6,369-input review closure lacks the underlying claim-specific raw CAS/name capture. This is **not a finding that the chemical identities or CAS numbers are wrong**.\n\n| Current target | Stable owner | Record | CAS |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| row-000843 | MIM:0000761 | CrKSO42_X_12_H2O | 7788-99-0 |\n| row-001561 | MIM:0001387 | KH2PO3 | 13977-65-6 |\n| row-002762 | MIM:0002450 | Tapso | 68399-81-5 |\n| row-002829 | MIM:0002512 | TitaniumIII_Chloride | 7705-07-9 |\n\nThe search covered all unique captured hashes in the current review input closure, including ignored inputs. It does not claim that no other historical raw capture exists anywhere. The old YAML fields and LLM research narratives are preserved, but they must not be relabeled as primary captures to pass the native `INSTALL_SUPPORTED` gate.\n\nEvidence: candidate SHA256 `95e6b52129f0d386baa97fa979344dcca2323506ff431420d49f6aaa53e91d15`; native selection `2c61399c7db7f5c90f254684a06dcd131105047cb104f6b6e341ae407e77cce7`; independent exact-row finding `ebcb63a3d1d787260dc73fde41e79c4332466e4a0883e2fe582770deceb12127`; live issue dedup receipt `48dc4cf983bc90ee4385884ea0a837d1bce7d62238731f5deb9a2d88d1f93a28`. Durable campaign paths are under `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/s3-publication-skeptic-actual-selection-v1/`.\n\nRelated scope: #1121 already holds the whole chromium potassium sulfate dodecahydrate owner pending a double-salt grounding decision. Filling its CAS capture gap must not clear that hold or approve its chromium sulfate parent. #718 remains the broader excluded-claim backlog. #1383 concerns malformed-CAS diagnostic handling and is a different defect. Exact-CAS and broader evidence/publication issue searches found no existing issue covering this four-row raw-capture gap.\n\nAcceptance:\n\n- Reuse and qualify an existing authentic raw capture where available; otherwise obtain bounded free primary evidence with acquisition URL/date/hash and supplied-form limits. No paid provider run is needed.\n- Have the current primary and separate skeptical reviewers assess the actual complete rows against those bytes. CAS/name or formula agreement alone cannot establish a source formulation or waive inherited scientific holds.\n- Keep unsupported rows `INSTALL_WITHHOLD`; preserve #1121 and every source, role, quantity and form hold. Do not edit records or invent an ontology match merely to close an evidence gap.\n- Bind accepted evidence into the native immutable publication reviews and retain the original missing-capture finding. Canonical installation and ordinary export approval remain separate gates.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}